			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401540101,
					"content": "经过这段时间的努力经营，炼金店铺的营业额达到了比预期中更高的数据…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401540102,
					"content": "哎呀，想不到短短一段时间，小可爱居然能把营业额提升到这个程度…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540103,
					"content": "莫非你是商业天才吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540104,
						401540107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540104,
					"content": "多亏了丽莎的帮助。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401540105,
					"content": "呵呵，你还是那么谦虚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540106,
					"content": "得到这么厉害的成果，可以再自豪一点的哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540109,
					"content": "要是能把你留在身边当助手，我的假期应该能再增加一倍吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540110,
					"content": "现阶段收集到的销售数据已经足够了。这段时间辛苦你们啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540111,
					"content": "当然，如果你愿意继续帮忙照看店铺，姐姐也会很高兴哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540112,
					"content": "这下，我也能跟琴交差了，呵呵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540113,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙，好久不见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540114,
					"content": "琴团长！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540115,
					"content": "你来了，我正想着跟小可爱交接完工作，就回骑士团找你呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540116,
					"content": "嗯，我已经从其他骑士那里了解了大致情况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540117,
					"content": "#想不到，这次你也让{NICKNAME}来帮忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540118,
					"content": "哎呀，这种重要的工作要想取得突破，精明能干的合作伙伴是不可或缺的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540119,
					"content": "你看，只有我的话可达不到这样的效率呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540120,
					"content": "确实，你们的成绩非常惊人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540121,
					"content": "本想将其他事务安排妥当之后就过来看看你们的情况，却一直抽不出时间…至少我想亲口表达对你们的感谢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540122,
						401540123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540122,
					"content": "琴团长一直在背后支持我们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401540124,
					"content": "嗯，有你们这样优秀的同伴，实在是令人安心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540125,
					"content": "呵呵，等事情告一段落，我是不是可以好好休个假了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540126,
					"content": "最近似乎头发都多掉了几根呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540127,
					"content": "没问题。这段时间辛苦你了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540128,
					"content": "之前我看你每天待在图书馆，时间长了或许会感到无聊，所以想安排一些更能发挥你才能的工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540129,
					"content": "是不是一下子给你增加太多压力了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540130,
					"content": "#其实也还好啦，毕竟有骑士团各位的支援，还有得力的同伴{NICKNAME}帮我分担工作。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540131,
					"content": "偶尔干回老本行，搞搞研究，也还挺有意思的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540132,
					"content": "嗯，你能这么想就好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540133,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，再次感谢你的付出。请收下这些报酬。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "琴"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540134,
					"content": "说到这个，姐姐我也为你做了个纪念品，希望你能喜欢哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				},
				{
					"id": 401540123,
					"content": "这是所有人一起努力的成果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401540107,
					"content": "不知不觉就找到诀窍了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401540108,
					"content": "嗯，你的学习能力果然非常强呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401540109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丽莎"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}